\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 Data Flow: Customer Message Translation\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f2\b0\fs26 \cf0 1. User opens Zendesk ticket\
2. MutationObserver detects new message\
3. processCustomerMessage() called\
4. detectLanguage() \uc0\u8594  API call \u8594  "de" (German)\
5. Update detectedCustomerLanguage = "de"\
6. Inject badge: "\uc0\u55356 \u56809 \u55356 \u56810  German"\
7. Inject button: "\uc0\u55357 \u56541  Translate to English"\
8. User clicks button\
9. translateWithGoogle(text, 'en', 'de')\
10. Check cache \uc0\u8594  miss\
11. Fetch from Google \uc0\u8594  "Dies ist ein Test" \u8594  "This is a test"\
12. Store in cache\
13. Display result in blue box\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 Data Flow: Reply Translation (v1.0.6)\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f2\b0\fs26 \cf0 1. User types English reply: "Hello, how can I help?"\
2. User clicks flag button (\uc0\u55356 \u56809 \u55356 \u56810 )\
3. Get reply text via innerText\
4. translateWithGoogle(text, 'de', 'en')\
5. Check cache \uc0\u8594  hit/miss\
6. Result: "Hallo, wie kann ich helfen?"\
7. Copy to clipboard: navigator.clipboard.writeText()\
8. Focus reply area\
9. WAIT 50ms\
10. Select all text (Selection API + execCommand)\
11. WAIT 50ms\
12. Try execCommand('paste') \uc0\u8594  usually fails\
13. Fallback: execCommand('delete')\
14. WAIT 50ms\
15. execCommand('insertText', translated)\
16. Move cursor to end\
17. \uc0\u9989  German text appears, fully editable\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

