\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\fs24 \cf0 Problem (v1.0.0 - v1.0.2):
\f1\b0  Setting 
\f2\fs26 innerHTML
\f1\fs24  didn't update visible text due to shadow DOM mirror.\

\f0\b Root Cause:
\f1\b0  Zendesk uses 
\f2\fs26 wsc-contenteditable-mirror
\f1\fs24  (WebSpellChecker) with closed shadow DOM.\

\f0\b Solution:
\f1\b0  Using 
\f2\fs26 execCommand
\f1\fs24  APIs instead of direct DOM manipulation.\

\f0\b Status:
\f1\b0  \uc0\u9989  RESOLVED in v1.0.3+\
